### ===================================================================
### GoBench Distributed Task Scheduling Platform - API Test Suite
### (Designed for VS Code "REST Client" Extension)
### ===================================================================
### Quick Start:
### 1. Run the server: `go run ./cmd/server/main.go`
### 2. Send request "2. 用户注册" to register a user.
### 3. Send request "3. 用户登录" to login and dynamically set the {{token}} variable.
### 4. Run any of the authorized endpoints below!
### ===================================================================

### 1. 系统健康检查 (无需权限)
GET http://localhost:8080/health
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. 用户注册
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "gnk48lb",
    "password": "8964"
}

###

### 3. 用户登录 (登录成功后会自动将 Token 注入 {{token}} 变量，无需手动复制)
# @name login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "gnk48lb",
    "password": "8964"
}

###

### ===================================================================
### 变量声明 (由登录接口返回值动态填充，若未填充可在此手动修改)
### ===================================================================
@token = {{login.response.body.data.token}}


### ===================================================================
### 任务管理模块 (CRUD) - 需 JWT 鉴权与限流控制 (10 req/min)
### ===================================================================

### 4. 创建任务 1 (正常 Function 计算类型)
# @name createTask1
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "抖音用户收益计算",
    "task_type": "function",
    "cron_expr": "0 0 * * *",
    "payload": "{\"batch_size\": 1000, \"simulate_count\": 1000000}",
    "retry_count": 3,
    "timeout": 120
}

###

### 5. 创建任务 2 (Shell 脚本类型)
# @name createTask2
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "清理过期视频缓存",
    "task_type": "shell",
    "cron_expr": "0 2 * * *",
    "payload": "{\"command\": \"echo 'Cleaning expired video cache...'\"}",
    "retry_count": 1,
    "timeout": 60
}

###

### 6. 获取任务列表 (带分页测试)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks?page=1&page_size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 7. 获取单个任务详情
### (默认读取刚创建的任务 1 的 ID, 也可以修改末尾的数字如 /1)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks/4
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 8. 更新任务属性及状态 (将状态更新为 paused 暂停)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "抖音用户收益计算-已暂停",
    "task_type": "function",
    "cron_expr": "0 0 * * *",
    "payload": "{\"batch_size\": 1000}",
    "retry_count": 5,
    "timeout": 120,
    "status": "paused"
}

###

### 9. 删除任务 (如需测试，可对任务 2 执行逻辑删除)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ===================================================================
### 高并发引擎、分布式队列与任务流转测试接口
### ===================================================================

### 10. 手动立即触发任务执行 (推入 Redis 队列并由 Worker 消费)
### (默认触发刚才创建的任务 1)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks/4/trigger
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 11. 获取该任务的执行历史日志列表 (带分页)
### (可以观察状态从 pending -> running -> success 变化，以及对应的 WorkerID)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks/4/logs?page=1&page_size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json


### ===================================================================
### 大规模计算模拟与分布式锁测试
### ===================================================================

### 12. 创建大规模百万用户收益计算任务
# @name createHeavyTask
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "硬核百万收益计算器",
    "task_type": "function",
    "cron_expr": "",
    "payload": "{\"batch_size\": 1000, \"simulate_count\": 1000000}",
    "retry_count": 3,
    "timeout": 120
}

###

### 13. 手动触发硬核百万计算任务 (验证 Worker 并发池与任务耗时模拟)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks/3/trigger
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 14. 查看该硬核任务的运行输出日志及执行进度
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks/3/logs?page=1&page_size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json


### ===================================================================
### 延迟队列与高可用分布式调度测试 (Phase 2 - Step 2.3 新增)
### ===================================================================

### 15. 延迟调度任务 (指定秒数后自动进入 Worker 消费队列)
### (默认将在 10 秒后触发，可修改 delay_seconds 进行自定义)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks/1/schedule
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "delay_seconds": 10
}

###

### 16. 获取刚才延迟调度任务的执行历史
### (延迟期间可以在此观察状态为 pending，15秒后状态变为 running -> success)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks/7/logs?page=1&page_size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json


### ===================================================================
### Shell 任务测试 (task_type: "shell")
### Windows 下使用 PowerShell；Linux/macOS 下自动切换为 bash
### ===================================================================

### 17. 创建任务：磁盘空间报告 (每小时定时执行一次)
### 结果会存进 task_log.output，可以在日志接口中查看
# @name createDiskReport
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "磁盘剩余空间报告",
    "task_type": "shell",
    "cron_expr": "0 * * * *",
    "payload": "{\"command\": \"Get-CimInstance Win32_LogicalDisk | Select-Object DeviceID, @{Name='FreeGB';Expression={[math]::round($_.FreeSpace/1GB,2)}}, @{Name='SizeGB';Expression={[math]::round($_.Size/1GB,2)}} | Format-Table -AutoSize\"}",
    "retry_count": 0,
    "timeout": 30
}

###

### 18. 立即触发磁盘报告任务
### 期望输出示例:
###   DeviceID FreeGB SizeGB
###   -------- ------ ------
###   C:         82.4  476.9
###   D:        320.1  931.5
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks/6/trigger
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 19. 创建任务：定时清理系统临时文件夹 (每天凌晨 3 点执行)
### Remove-Item 删除 $env:TEMP 下所有内容，-ErrorAction SilentlyContinue
### 确保跳过被锁文件而不中断任务
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "清理系统 Temp 文件夹",
    "task_type": "shell",
    "cron_expr": "0 3 * * *",
    "payload": "{\"command\": \"$before = (Get-ChildItem $env:TEMP -Recurse -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | Measure-Object -Property Length -Sum).Sum; Remove-Item -Path \\\"$env:TEMP\\\\*\\\" -Recurse -Force -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue; $after = (Get-ChildItem $env:TEMP -Recurse -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | Measure-Object -Property Length -Sum).Sum; Write-Output \\\"Cleaned approx $([math]::round(($before-$after)/1MB, 2)) MB from Temp folder.\\\"\"}",
    "retry_count": 0,
    "timeout": 60
}

###

### 20. 创建任务：清理指定文件夹内容 (如 QQ 视频缓存)
### ⚠️  将 payload 里的路径换成你实际想清理的目录再触发
### 这里只删除目录内的文件，不删除目录本身；-ErrorAction SilentlyContinue
### 确保路径不存在时任务也能正常结束（输出为空而不是报错）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "清理 QQ 视频缓存",
    "task_type": "shell",
    "cron_expr": "0 4 * * *",
    "payload": "{\"command\": \"$path = 'D:\\\\QQ\\\\Tencent Files\\\\2501342338\\\\Video'; if (Test-Path $path) { $count = (Get-ChildItem $path -File).Count; Remove-Item -Path \\\"$path\\\\*\\\" -Recurse -Force -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue; Write-Output \\\"Deleted $count file(s) from $path\\\" } else { Write-Output \\\"Path not found: $path\\\" }\"}",
    "retry_count": 0,
    "timeout": 30
}

###

### 21. 创建任务：清空回收站 (每天深夜执行)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "定时清空回收站",
    "task_type": "shell",
    "cron_expr": "0 2 * * *",
    "payload": "{\"command\": \"Clear-RecycleBin -Force -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue; Write-Output 'Recycle Bin cleared.'\"}",
    "retry_count": 0,
    "timeout": 30
}

###


### ===================================================================
### HTTP 任务测试 (task_type: "http")
### ===================================================================

### 22. 创建任务：一言（Hitokoto）随机名言
### 每次执行从动漫/文学语录中随机返回一句话，存入日志
### 可以设置 cron 每小时跑一次，MySQL 里就攒了一本语录
# @name createHitokoto
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "每日一言",
    "task_type": "http",
    "cron_expr": "0 * * * *",
    "payload": "{\"url\": \"https://v1.hitokoto.cn/\", \"method\": \"GET\"}",
    "retry_count": 2,
    "timeout": 10
}

###

### 23. 立即触发一言任务
### 期望 output 格式:
###   Status: 200 | Latency: 142ms
###   {"id":6182,"uuid":"...","hitokoto":"我们的征途是星辰大海","from":"银河英雄传说",...}
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks/7/trigger
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 24. 创建任务：公网 IP 监控
### 每小时查询一次你的公网 IP；如果你家是动态宽带，
### 这个任务会记录 IP 每次变化的时间点
# @name createIPMonitor
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "公网 IP 监控",
    "task_type": "http",
    "cron_expr": "5 * * * *",
    "payload": "{\"url\": \"https://api.ipify.org?format=json\", \"method\": \"GET\"}",
    "retry_count": 1,
    "timeout": 10
}

###

### 25. 立即触发公网 IP 查询
### 期望 output 格式:
###   Status: 200 | Latency: 88ms
###   {"ip":"114.xxx.xxx.xxx"}
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks/8/trigger
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###


### ===================================================================
### 并发站点可用性检测 - Batch Ping (task_type: "function", function: "batch_ping")
### 这是展示 Go 并发优势最直接的任务：
### 20 个 URL 并发检测，总耗时 ≈ 最慢那一个，而不是 20 个加起来
### ===================================================================

### 26. 创建 Batch Ping 任务 (检测常用站点可达性)
# @name createBatchPing
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "站点可用性检测",
    "task_type": "function",
    "cron_expr": "*/15 * * * *",
    "payload": "{\"function\": \"batch_ping\", \"urls\": [\"https://github.com\", \"https://www.google.com\", \"https://www.baidu.com\", \"https://stackoverflow.com\", \"https://pkg.go.dev\", \"https://hub.docker.com\", \"https://pypi.org\", \"https://www.cloudflare.com\", \"https://www.bilibili.com\", \"https://www.zhihu.com\", \"https://api.ipify.org\", \"https://v1.hitokoto.cn\", \"https://httpbin.org/get\", \"https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com\", \"https://www.youtube.com\", \"https://x.com\", \"https://www.reddit.com\", \"https://npmjs.com\", \"https://crates.io\"], \"timeout_seconds\": 5}",
    "retry_count": 0,
    "timeout": 15
}

###

### 27. 立即触发 Batch Ping 任务
### 期望输出格式（task_log.output）:
###
###   Batch Ping — 20 URLs (per-request timeout: 5s)
###   ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
###     ✓ 200  https://github.com                               312ms
###     ✓ 200  https://www.baidu.com                             58ms
###     ✓ 200  https://pkg.go.dev                               280ms
###     ✗ ERR  https://www.google.com       dial tcp: ...timeout...
###     ...
###   ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
###     Result: 17/20 reachable  |  Wall clock: 5.02s
###
### 注意 Wall clock 约等于 5s（超时时间），而不是 20 * 平均延迟
### 这就是 goroutine 并发的实际效果
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks/10/trigger
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 28. 查看 Batch Ping 执行日志
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks/10/logs?page=1&page_size=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 29. 创建一个简化版 Batch Ping（只测国内常用站点，延迟更低）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "国内站点可用性检测",
    "task_type": "function",
    "cron_expr": "*/30 * * * *",
    "payload": "{\"function\": \"batch_ping\", \"urls\": [\"https://www.baidu.com\", \"https://www.bilibili.com\", \"https://www.zhihu.com\", \"https://www.taobao.com\", \"https://www.jd.com\", \"https://www.weibo.com\", \"https://www.douban.com\", \"https://music.163.com\"], \"timeout_seconds\": 3}",
    "retry_count": 0,
    "timeout": 10
}

###


### ===================================================================
### 滑动窗口限流控制测试 (Rate Limiting)
### ===================================================================
### 提示: 我们的 RateLimitMiddleware 设置为了 10次/分钟。
### 你可以快速、连续点击发送上述任意带有 /tasks 的请求 (例如 "6. 获取任务列表")。
### 超过 10 次后，服务器将返回 HTTP 429 Too Many Requests 错误，包含 JSON:
### { "code": 429, "msg": "too many requests" }
### ===================================================================

### ===================================================================
### 统计监控 API (Phase 3)
### ===================================================================

### 30. 获取整体执行统计数据 (最近24小时内的任务总数、成功率、平均耗时等)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 31. 获取单个任务的执行统计数据
### 默认获取任务 1 的统计数据，可修改 ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks/1/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
